# 3 locks — all sports and the rest of the site

**Before any site work:** every sport, every results card, and the rest of the
site are locked. Unlock only the surface the owner named, and only when that
message contains **UNLOCK** 3 times plus the miss.

All locked (picks + results + the rest of the site): MLB, NHL, NBA, NFL, NCAAF,
NCAAB, NCAAW, WNBA, CFL, soccer, tennis, UFC, golf, props, performance, chrome,
header, footer, hamburger, homepage, blog, account.

Owner 2026-09-22: NHL, MLB, and NCAAF were opened for the picks-card misses
(dead predictions image, Efficiency N/A, placeholder Edge). Those misses are
closed. All three are locked again.

A hang, timeout, checker fail, or blank-slate restore for sport A is not an
unlock for sport B. Do not touch `NHL77FINAL.py` / `team_results_charts.py`
for a locked sport.

